{"New boolean flag column 'cancelled' is added as nullable without a default, causing existing and future rows to have NULL instead of false, which breaks queries filtering on false (WHERE cancelled = false will exclude NULL rows)": 0.8244380950927734, "Phone input onChange handler calls .find on verifiedNumbers without guarding for undefined, causing runtime TypeError when verified numbers query has not yet loaded and user types in phone field": 0.48342597484588623, "Imported Prisma symbol is never used in the file, which will trigger TypeScript/ESLint unused-import errors and can break strict CI pipelines": 0.2843776047229767}